cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the analysis plan, please cite it as below."
title: "India's State TB Score: reproducibility, robustness and validity — analysis code and pre-registered plan"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered analysis plan, and the code that implements it, for a
  test of India's State TB Score: whether the published 2023 State TB Scores
  can be reproduced from the indicator values the India TB Report publishes,
  how stable the ranking is to defensible alternative choices, whether higher
  scores go with lower TB prevalence in the ICMR National TB Prevalence Survey
  2019-21, and whether year-on-year changes in the score exceed indicator
  noise.
type: software
authors:
